{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d17556c20ce96d38","name":"Telepath Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-d17556c20ce96d38","title":"Telepath Talent Tree","revision":20549,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:03:55Z","sha256":"6044c56d3a8de96199f1db6190f5f70c1ec08911bca89b367688330e411e7b94","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20549","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Telepath%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d17556c20ce96d38","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have mastered the art of mental manipulation, using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to touch, read, and affect the minds of others with ease.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mind Probe"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you touch a living creature with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 3 or higher, you can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to probe its mind for secrets. You must be adjacent to the target, and using the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Mind Probe"]}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". If the target is unwilling, you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, equaling or exceeding the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". This ability otherwise functions exactly as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," skill's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Learn News and Rumors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Learn_News_and_Rumors"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Learn Secret Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Learn_Secret_Information"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locate Individual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locate_Individual"}," applications.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check must still exceed the base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," skill DCs in order to retrieve the information you seek, but you need not pay anything in bribes, and you retrieve the information as a part of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". Failing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," by 5 or more does not cause someone to notice that you are seeking the information.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Perfect Telepathy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can communicate in full sentences and complete thoughts when you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," aspect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, instead of just in basic phrases. However, the target of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," can still only communicate in basic emotions or single thoughts.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Psychic Citadel"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," equal to your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Psychic Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Psychic Citadel"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever another creature targets you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] descriptor, it automatically takes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage equal to 1d6 x your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," modifier (minimum x1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Telepathic Intruder"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] descriptor successfully against a target, until the end of your next turn you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," made to activate [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talents"}," against that same target.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
